  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farclightsmp.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/ikdage.gif\" width=\"468\" height=\"60\"></a><br><strong>广告： </strong>Arclight SMP - 随心所欲。但请记住，其他人也可以这么做。自定义生物群系、300+ 种建筑、危险生物、自定义附魔、技能、可复活的宠物以及城镇。<br>领地外允许 PvP 和袭击。实验性太空探索（该功能可能保留或移除）。唯一规则：禁止作弊。<br><strong>Java (1.9-1.21.11)：</strong>play.arclightsmp.com | <strong>基岩版：</strong>端口 19199<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Borderless Glass（无边玻璃）是一款简单轻量的资源包，通过移除所有类型玻璃方块的边框来提升你的 Minecraft 体验。告别难看的边框，让你的建筑拥有更干净、更具沉浸感的玻璃效果。本资源包兼容广泛的 Minecraft 版本，你可根据自己的游戏版本选择对应资源包。立即下载，为你的玻璃方块赋予流畅无缝的视觉体验！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JtZ7K577Pt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>加入 Discord 服务器</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>此外，还请查看：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mahis-connected-grass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahi's Connected Grass</a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mahis-better-sky\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahi's Better Sky</a><br><br></strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deadworld-survival-zombie-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>DeadWorld Survival: Zombie Apocalypse (整合包)：</strong></a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deadworld-survival-zombie-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在充满敌意的世界中生存，抵御无情的僵尸末日。任何声音、气味或光线都会引来危险。凭借现代武器，你需要运用策略与技巧，在恶劣环境中生存并抵挡不断逼近的尸潮。</a><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/845743/description_db3e065c-2342-493e-a8ca-77806fcf771e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"487\"><br></strong></span></p>",
